          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "leased facilities to seven third party vessels and protection for three of our own vessels using this"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          487.2368542161521,
          294.8837091176471,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "technique by the cyclone season in 2001."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          529.112742280285,
          680.2233633193277,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "As more vessels seek protection, additional breakwaters can be constructed and sea room"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          550.0513010688836,
          680.2181607983193,
          11.820830760094964
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "dredged. Each mooring involves a pattern of pin piles drilled into the granite sea floor with four"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          570.9898476840856,
          567.8013977731093,
          11.820842933491633
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "vessel specific mooring lines secured to special attachment points on the vessel."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          612.8657357482185,
          680.1917175210084,
          11.82084293349169
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Many smaller vessels including Mermaid’s will be lifted from the water and tied down on purpose"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.6919936554622,
          633.8042823634204,
          180.83282735294122,
          11.820842933491747
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "built cradles for cyclones."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          706.9709735748219,
          680.1970234033613,
          11.820867280285029
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Like our neighbours, much of the Mermaid site is below the prescribed storm surge level, or"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          727.9095323634205,
          680.1970234033613,
          11.82085510688836
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "needs some degree of earthworks to maximize its value. Currently 8 of the 17 ha of the area is"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          748.8480911520189,
          316.3102918907563,
          11.82085510688836
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "suitable for development in its present state."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          790.7239670427554,
          680.1987633193278,
          11.820867280285029
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "The spoil produced from dredging will allow Mermaid to achieve full utilization of the site at a"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          811.662525831354,
          369.94180617647055,
          11.82085510688836
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "fraction of the cost of importing fill from elsewhere."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          853.5384017220903,
          680.2374549159664,
          11.820867280285086
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Considerable effort has gone into anticipating the future direction of the Base. Planning services"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          874.4769605106889,
          680.2128549159664,
          11.820855106888331
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "such as traffic flows, land allocation and security, as well as fulfilling the many and complex"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          895.4155192992874,
          680.2427607983193,
          11.820845368171021
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "regulatory requirements related to health, safety, quarantine, environmental management, dust,"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          916.3540695665083,
          680.2145776050421,
          11.820850237529669
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "dangerous goods and hazchem materials have been the subject of considerable study prior to this"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          148.69374046218488,
          937.2926234857482,
          163.33696626050423,
          11.82085510688836
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/Goudy",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "implementation stage. "
      }
    ],
